    {
      "id": "6vku4l0lb",
      "node_id": "node-term-profile-shortlist-0a91ce72",
      "version_tag": "v1",
      "title": "Term Profile Shortlist",
      "description": {
        "text": {
          "text": {
            "text": {
              "text": {
                "text": "Retrieves term insurance policy excerpts and builds a prompt for LLM to rank the top 5 plans.\n\nThis node creates a prompt for an LLM to shortlist the five best term life insurance policies for a user, using only the user profile, a scorecard, and vector database retrieval. It first parses the user profile to extract key attributes (desired sum assured, policy term, critical illness rider, return of premium preference) and constructs a retrieval query combining these terms with \"term life insurance India\" and \"features benefits premium exclusions\". The node queries the insurance vector database with top_k=40 to obtain relevant policy excerpts, then inserts these together with the user profile and the scorecard (containing rubrics, hard filters, and weights) into a structured prompt. The LLM is instructed to apply hard filters, compute seven criterion scores (0‑10) for each policy, apply profile‑adaptive weights, drop ineligible policies, and output exactly the top five plans in a strict TOP_5_READY format. This ensures a transparent, data‑driven shortlist for term life insurance.",
                "lineHeight": 14,
                "fontSize": 11,
                "fontFamily": "-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, sans-serif"
              },
              "lineHeight": 14,
              "fontSize": 11,
              "fontFamily": "-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, sans-serif"
            },
            "lineHeight": 14,
            "fontSize": 11,
            "fontFamily": "-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, sans-serif"
          },
          "lineHeight": 14,
          "fontSize": 11,
          "fontFamily": "-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, sans-serif"
        },
        "lineHeight": 14,
        "fontSize": 11,
        "fontFamily": "-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, sans-serif"
      },
