    {
      "id": "6c12d5wtb",
      "node_id": "node-accept-term-lifestyle-e483b6dd",
      "version_tag": "v1",
      "title": "Accept Term Lifestyle",
      "description": {
        "text": {
          "text": {
            "text": {
              "text": {
                "text": "Normalizes term insurance lifestyle preferences and importance ratings into a pipe‑delimited string.\n\nThis node transforms user lifestyle and preference inputs for term life insurance into a standardized pipe‑separated string. It accepts twelve parameters: existing policy details, annual budget for premiums, medical underwriting willingness, payout preference (lump sum or income option), want income option, and importance ratings (low/medium/high) for seven criteria: claim settlement ratio, premium competitiveness, maximum sum assured, age range flexibility, riders and benefits, premium payment flexibility, and insurer solvency and trust. The node provides defaults for missing values (e.g., \"none\" for existing policy, \"not_specified\" for budget) and assembles the string with labels like ExistingPolicy, BudgetAnnual, MedicalUnderwriting, PayoutPref, and ImpClaimSettlement. This structured output allows downstream recommendation engines to incorporate the user's stated priorities when ranking and recommending term insurance policies.",
                "lineHeight": 14,
                "fontSize": 11,
                "fontFamily": "-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, sans-serif"
              },
              "lineHeight": 14,
              "fontSize": 11,
              "fontFamily": "-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, sans-serif"
            },
            "lineHeight": 14,
            "fontSize": 11,
